tool.vanishing_point.name = Tununyɔrɔ
tool.vanishing_point.description = I ka yɔrɔ tilennen sama ka da fɛn kan min bɛ peresipɛktivi kɔnɔ; o kɔ, cogoya yɛlɛma ka kɛ Kopi ye ka bɔrɔsi: pikisɛli kopilenw bɛ o yɔrɔ tilennen sira taama, ka dɔgɔya ni u bɔra ka jan.
